  "details": "[VRChat 2026.2.2p1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202622p1) implemented the following change:\n\n> Fixed overflowing instance details text in Quick Menu and Main Menu for instances with multiple modifiers (avatar performance gates, queues, hype train, etc.).\n\n\"Report a World\" Help & Info still uses a photo of the UI predating this change. In the Help & Info photo, the \"Region and Instance Population\" (sic) is located on the left side of \"Instance Population\" (these used to be merged). In the live build (1864), the \"Region and Instance Population\" (sic) icon is on the right side of \"Instance Population\".\n\nAdditionally, the location of instance type (e.g. \"Invite\") has been repositioned.",
